prim:Real prim:rhoObject prim:Float64 .
prim:Set prim:rhoObject prim:SetSortedEncoding .
prim:String prim:rhoObject prim:StringUtf8ByteVector .
prim:Sum prim:rhoObject prim:SumTaggedUnionEncoding .
prim:Tensor prim:rhoObject prim:TensorShapedBlockEncoding .
prim:Time prim:rhoObject prim:TimeInt64Nanos .
prim:Triple prim:rhoObject prim:TripleNTriplesProduct .
prim:Tuple prim:rhoObject prim:TupleProductEncoding .
prim:URI prim:rhoObject prim:UriUtf8 .
prim:URN prim:rhoObject prim:URN_PhysicalEncoding .
prim:Unit prim:rhoObject prim:UnitEncoding .
prim:UnitOfMeasure prim:rhoObject prim:UnitOfMeasureUint16Index .
prim:Vector prim:rhoObject prim:VectorDenseArrayEncoding .
prim:Void prim:rhoObject prim:VoidEmptyEncoding .

# ---- realization transports of SUBTYPE arrows (rho on cover morphisms) ----
prim:rt_sub_Bag_FormalType a prim:RealizationTransport ;
    prim:transportOf prim:sub_Bag_FormalType ; prim:transportDom prim:BagMultisetEncoding ; prim:transportCod prim:ByteVector ;
    rdfs:label "rho(sub_Bag_FormalType): BagMultisetEncoding -> ByteVector" ;
    rdfs:comment "The realization functor rho applied to the subtype arrow sub_Bag_FormalType (prim:Bag sub prim:FormalType): a genuine morphism rho(prim:Bag) to rho(prim:FormalType) in the physical carrier category, i.e. the realization-compatibility edge relating the canonical carrier prim:BagMultisetEncoding of prim:Bag to the canonical carrier prim:ByteVector of prim:FormalType. Its prim:transportOf names the formal arrow sub_Bag_FormalType whose rho-image it is; prim:transportDom and prim:transportCod are pinned to rho of that arrow's domain and codomain, so the functor square commutes on the nose. This is the on-arrows action of rho promoted from a mere object map to a real functor, making the subtyping-compatible relationship between the two carriers an inspectable graph fact." .
prim:rt_sub_Bignum_Integer a prim:RealizationTransport ;
    prim:transportOf prim:sub_Bignum_Integer ; prim:transportDom prim:Bignum_PhysicalEncoding ; prim:transportCod prim:Int32 ;
    rdfs:label "rho(sub_Bignum_Integer): Bignum_PhysicalEncoding -> Int32" ;
    rdfs:comment "The realization functor rho applied to the subtype arrow sub_Bignum_Integer (prim:Bignum sub prim:Integer): a genuine morphism rho(prim:Bignum) to rho(prim:Integer) in the physical carrier category, i.e. the realization-compatibility edge relating the canonical carrier prim:Bignum_PhysicalEncoding of prim:Bignum to the canonical carrier prim:Int32 of prim:Integer. Its prim:transportOf names the formal arrow sub_Bignum_Integer whose rho-image it is; prim:transportDom and prim:transportCod are pinned to rho of that arrow's domain and codomain, so the functor square commutes on the nose. This is the on-arrows action of rho promoted from a mere object map to a real functor, making the subtyping-compatible relationship between the two carriers an inspectable graph fact." .
prim:rt_sub_BlankNode_FormalType a prim:RealizationTransport ;
    prim:transportOf prim:sub_BlankNode_FormalType ; prim:transportDom prim:BlankNodeUtf8LocalId ; prim:transportCod prim:ByteVector ;
    rdfs:label "rho(sub_BlankNode_FormalType): BlankNodeUtf8LocalId -> ByteVector" ;
    rdfs:comment "The realization functor rho applied to the subtype arrow sub_BlankNode_FormalType (prim:BlankNode sub prim:FormalType): a genuine morphism rho(prim:BlankNode) to rho(prim:FormalType) in the physical carrier category, i.e. the realization-compatibility edge relating the canonical carrier prim:BlankNodeUtf8LocalId of prim:BlankNode to the canonical carrier prim:ByteVector of prim:FormalType. Its prim:transportOf names the formal arrow sub_BlankNode_FormalType whose rho-image it is; prim:transportDom and prim:transportCod are pinned to rho of that arrow's domain and codomain, so the functor square commutes on the nose. This is the on-arrows action of rho promoted from a mere object map to a real functor, making the subtyping-compatible relationship between the two carriers an inspectable graph fact." .
prim:rt_sub_Blob_FormalType a prim:RealizationTransport ;
    prim:transportOf prim:sub_Blob_FormalType ; prim:transportDom prim:BlobOpaqueByteVector ; prim:transportCod prim:ByteVector ;
    rdfs:label "rho(sub_Blob_FormalType): BlobOpaqueByteVector -> ByteVector" ;
    rdfs:comment "The realization functor rho applied to the subtype arrow sub_Blob_FormalType (prim:Blob sub prim:FormalType): a genuine morphism rho(prim:Blob) to rho(prim:FormalType) in the physical carrier category, i.e. the realization-compatibility edge relating the canonical carrier prim:BlobOpaqueByteVector of prim:Blob to the canonical carrier prim:ByteVector of prim:FormalType. Its prim:transportOf names the formal arrow sub_Blob_FormalType whose rho-image it is; prim:transportDom and prim:transportCod are pinned to rho of that arrow's domain and codomain, so the functor square commutes on the nose. This is the on-arrows action of rho promoted from a mere object map to a real functor, making the subtyping-compatible relationship between the two carriers an inspectable graph fact." .
prim:rt_sub_Bool_Kleene3 a prim:RealizationTransport ;
